# UI/UX Pro Max - Cursor Rules

## Overview
This skill provides professional UI/UX design capabilities for UI/UX Pro Max framework.

## Capabilities

### 1. Generate UI/UX Design Documents
- Complete color specifications (CSS variables)
- Detailed layout structure (ASCII diagrams)
- Component specifications (dimensions, content, colors)
- Interaction and animation guidelines

### 2. Generate Figma Make Prompts
- Structured English prompts for AI prototype generation
- Complete design specifications
- Ready-to-use prompts

### 3. Provide Frontend Code Recommendations
- Technology stack suggestions
- Directory structure
- Component breakdown
- Chart library configurations (ECharts, AntV)

## Usage

### For Data Dashboards
```
"Help me design a production monitoring dashboard showing:
- Production statistics
- Equipment status
- Energy monitoring
- Inventory levels
Style: Dark tech theme
Resolution: 1920×1080"
```

### For Landing Pages
```
"Help me design a SaaS product landing page
Industry: AI/Chatbot platform
Style: Hero-Centric + Social Proof
Include: Hero, Features, Testimonials, Pricing, CTA"
```

### For Mobile Apps
```
"Help me design a WeChat Mini Program for ERP system
Pages: Dashboard, Equipment, Inventory, Reports
Navigation: Tab bar with 5 tabs"
```

## Output Format

### 1. UI/UX Design Document
```markdown
# Project Name

## Overview
- Resolution: 1920×1080
- Style: Dark tech theme
- Refresh rate: Real-time

## Color Specifications
```css
--bg-primary: #0a1628;
--color-primary: #00f0ff;
...
```

## Layout Structure
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Header (60px)                          │
├──────────┬──────────────┬───────────────┤
│ Card 1   │   Card 2     │    Card 3     │
│ 280×220  │   1360×400   │   280×220     │
├──────────┴──────────────┴───────────────┤
│  Footer (50px)                          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Component Details
### Component Name (Position)
- Dimensions: W×H
- Content: [detailed description]
- Colors: [specific colors]
```

### 2. Figma Make Prompt
```markdown
Create a [type] for [purpose].

Specifications:
- Canvas size: [dimensions]
- Style: [theme]
- Color palette: [colors]

Layout Structure:
[Detailed layout description]

UI Elements:
- All cards: Rounded corners (8px), subtle glow on hover
- Progress bars: Smooth animation, gradient fill
- Charts: ECharts-style with smooth lines
...
```

### 3. Frontend Code Recommendations
```json
{
  "framework": "Vue 3 + TypeScript",
  "chart-library": "ECharts 5.x",
  "ui-components": "Element Plus",
  "state-management": "Pinia",
  "websocket": "Socket.io-client"
