└── ...
```

## Design Principles

### Color Theory
- Use industry-appropriate color palettes
- Ensure WCAG AA accessibility compliance
- Implement dark mode support
- Apply gradient effects where appropriate

### Layout Patterns
- Grid-based layouts (3 columns standard)
- Card-based component systems
- Responsive breakpoints (375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px)

### Typography
- Establish clear hierarchy
- Use monospace for numbers/data
- Maintain proper spacing (8px grid)

### Interaction Design
- Smooth transitions (200-300ms)
- Hover states for all interactive elements
- Loading states and skeletons
- Error states and validations

## Quality Checklist

Before delivering any design:

- [ ] No emojis as icons (use SVG: Heroicons/Lucide)
- [ ] cursor-pointer on all clickable elements
- [ ] Hover states with smooth transitions (150-300ms)
- [ ] Light mode: text contrast 4.5:1 minimum
- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard nav
- [ ] prefers-reduced-motion respected
- [ ] Responsive: 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px
- [ ] Accessibility: WCAG AA compliant

## Integration

### Tools
- Figma Make - AI prototype generation
- Cursor - Code generation
- OpenClaw - Project management
- GitHub - Version control

### Frameworks
- Vue 3 + Element Plus
- React + Ant Design
- Next.js + Tailwind CSS
- Flutter (mobile)
- WeChat Mini Program (小程序)

### Chart Libraries
- ECharts 5.x
- AntV G2
- Chart.js
- D3.js

